# Sentry scope

This Cursor project is Acorn. Sentry is signed in to the whole `kevin-mow` account, which also contains other products. Do not read those.

When using Sentry from this repo:

- Organization: `kevin-mow`
- Region: `https://de.sentry.io`
- Project slug: `react-native` (the project is named Acorn Desktop)

Pass that project on every search. Do not list issues, events, or projects for the account without it. If a result is from another project, drop it and do not describe it.
